# Force LF for every text file in this deploy slice.
#
# The canonical repo stores LF. A clone made on Windows without this can check
# out CRLF, and then a sync diff is 100% of every file touched -- which makes a
# real change unreviewable and hides what actually moved.
#
# sync_tool.sh also clones with -c core.autocrlf=false and asserts the diff is
# identical with and without --ignore-cr-at-eol. This file is the durable half
# of that guard, for anyone who clones by hand later.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
